        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Juc Dee-bid kɛ ji̱ Ä-ma-lek",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Täämɛ mëë ci Dee-bid ben kä Dhik-lag kɛnɛ nɛɛkɛ. Kɛ diɔ̱ɔ̱k ni̱ni, cu ji̱ Ä-ma-lek Nɛ-gɛb kɛnɛ Dhik-lag ma̱k. Cukɛ Dhik-lag joc kä cukɛ wec waŋ, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cukɛ män pɛc kɛnɛ tin diaal tin te thi̱n, kä cuɛ thil ram mi cua näk, cukɛ naŋ ni ti diaal, kä cukɛ wä dupdiɛn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë ci Dee-bid kɛnɛ nɛɛkɛ ben wi̱c, cukɛ jɛ jek a cɛ waaŋ, kä ca mänkiɛn kɛ gaatkiɛn naŋ ala pɛ̈ɛ̈c. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu Dee-bid kɛnɛ nɛɛkɛ wiee kɛ jɔw mi di̱i̱t. Amäni mëë cɛ ro̱lkiɛn thɔ̱t. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä män Dee-bid da̱ŋ rɛw cakɛ pɛc bä, Ä-ɣi-no-am kä Yidh-rɛɛl kɛnɛ Ä-bi-ga-yil ciek Na-bal ëë ci li̱w kä Kar-mɛl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Dee-bid riɛk ɛlɔ̱ŋ. Duundɛ ɣöö cu Dee-bid rɔ bum kɛ Kuoth Nhial Kuothdɛ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Dee-bid Ɛb-ya-thar bo̱o̱th palä gat Ä-ɣi-mɛ-lɛk jiök i̱ “No̱ŋ ni ɣä gaakni.” Cu Ɛb-ya-thar jɛ nöŋ gaakni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Dee-bid Kuoth Nhial thiec i̱, “Ɣän bä nɛy tɔ̱tɔ̱ guɔ̱ɔ̱r?” Kä cu Kuoth ɛ loc i̱, “Guuri kɛ. Bikɛ cop, kä bi nɛy tin ca pɛc luäk.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ jiɛɛn kɛnɛ nɛɛkɛ ti kur bäkɛl, kä cukɛ ben thok yiëër Bɛ-thor, cu tha̱a̱ŋdiɛn duɔth thi̱n. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Dee-bid kɛ guɔ̱ɔ̱r kɛnɛ nɛy ti kur ŋuaan. Cu nɛy ti kur rɛw duɔth ti /ka̱n yier Bɛ-thor jiath kui̱c kɛ ɣöö cikɛ cuuc.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cukɛ raan I-jëp jek thok wec, kä cua jɛ nöŋ Dee-bid. Kä cukɛ jɛ moc mi̱eth mi camɛ, kɛnɛ pi̱ ti bɛ math, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cukɛ jɛ moc kɛ töl patdä buɔ̱ɔ̱kä kɛnɛ kar dɛɛni jiɛɛn da̱ŋ rɛw. Kä min cɛ thuɔ̱k kɛ mi̱eth cuɛ yieykɛ jek. Kɛ ɣöö /kenɛ mi̱th kä /kenɛ maath kɛ pi̱ kɛ cäŋdääri diɔ̱k kɛ wääri diɔ̱k. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Dee-bid ɛ thiec i̱, “Ɛ ji̱n raan nikä? Kä bi nikä?” Kä cuɛ loc i̱, “Ɛ ɣän raan I-jëp, mi läät ji̱ Ä-ma-lek. Ci kuäärä ɣä ba̱ny jɔk kɛ ɣöö cɛ ɣä moc kɛ juey kɛ ni̱n diɔ̱k tëë ci wä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ca̱kɔ wec ji̱ Kɛ-rith min la duŋ Juda, kɛnɛ wec Ka-leb wä ma̱k, kä ca̱kɔ Dhik-lag cua̱th kɛ mac.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Dee-bid ɛ jiök i̱, “Deri ɣä nöŋ nɛy tɔ̱tɔ̱?” Kä cuɛ loc i̱, “Yac rɔ kɛ ciöt Kuɔth Nhial, ɛn ɣöö /ci ɣä bi näk, kä /ci ɣä bi ka̱m kuäärä kɛ ɣöö bä ji̱ ku lɛ nöŋ buɔ̱n ɛ mɔ.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä min cɛ Dee-bid naŋ, ɛn buɔ̱n ɛmɔ cikɛ rɔ da̱k piny kɛn diaal rɛy wec. Mi̱thkɛ, kä mäthkɛ, kä ŋarkɛ, kɛ kui̱ kä tin diaal tin ca pɛc wi̱i̱ni Pi-li-thɛt kɛnɛ wec Juda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Dee-bid nyieenykɛ kɛ ni mi̱rä, cu mäni mëë ruɔ̱ndɛ kɛ thiaŋ thiaŋ. Kä cu kään ni ŋuɛ̈tni ti kur ŋuaan, ti ca rɔ bar kɛ thɔ̱a̱rɔa̱a̱li. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ tëë diaal tëë ci ji̱ Ä-ma-lek kɛ ka̱n luɔ̱c jɔk kä cuɛ mänkɛ da̱ŋ rɛw kän bä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ thil mi te jɔ̱ɔ̱r, mi di̱i̱t kiɛ mi tɔt, kä kɛn tëë diaal tëë ca pɛc. Cu Dee-bid kɛn diaal nööŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ ɣɔ̱k kɛnɛ det lɛni pɛc. Kä cu nɛɛkɛ kɛ cuac nhiam ɣɔ̱ɔ̱kiɛn, kä cuɛ wee i̱, “Kɛ pɛ̈ɛ̈c Dee-bid kɛn ti̱ti̱.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Dee-bid ben kä nɛy ti kur da̱ŋ rɛw tëë ci cuuc, kä ci duɔth thok yiëër Be-dhor. Cukɛ ben ba Dee-bid ben lor kɛnɛ nɛy tin ci wä kɛɛl kɛ jɛ. Kä min cɛ cop kutdiɛn, cuɛ kɛ ner. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu tha̱a̱ŋ nath ti camjiɛɛc kä nɛy tin ci wä kɛɛl kɛ Dee-bid wee i̱, “Kɛ ɣöö/ken kɛ wä kɛɛl kɛ kɔn, /canɛ kɛ bi moc kɛ pɛ̈ɛ̈c tin canɛ wä pɛc, bi ramɔ ka̱n ni ciekdɛ kɛnɛ gaatkɛ kä rɔ.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duundɛ ɣöö cu Dee-bid wee i̱, “/Cuarɛ nɔmɔ lät, kuɛ la ŋu moc Kuoth Nhial kɔn kɛ jɛ mɔ gaatmaar. Cɛ kɔn gaŋ kä cuɛ buɔ̱n nɛɛni tin ca kɔn ma̱k ka̱m kɔn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thilɛ ram mi bi mat kɛ yɛ kä min lat yɛnɛ? Kä min bia̱ kui̱c raam mi ci wä ko̱o̱r, ɛ jɛn bia̱ kui̱c raam in ci duɔth kut kuakni ɔ. Bi kɛn diaal pa̱a̱r.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Dee-bid nɔmɔ la̱t ala ŋuɔ̱t kä I-thɛ-rɛl ɛn cäŋɛ mɔ mäni walɛ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
